<h1>Pensions and social care: the plan announced in September 2026</h1>

<p class="lede">On {{ ("pm-care-2026-09-29" | sourceRecord).published_date | dateText }} the Prime Minister announced two things together. One is a new rule for the yearly increase in the State Pension, from April 2030. {{ ("ifs-real-rise-slower" | claim).statement }} {{ m.c("ifs-real-rise-slower") }} The other is a National Care Service with free personal care for older people, using the savings. This page sets out what was announced, what is in law, what has only been reported, and which questions the plan leaves open.</p>

